IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-HTTP-STREAM.

DATA DIVISION.
01 STATUS-CODE         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HEADER-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BODY-LEN            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 STREAM-HEALTH-SCORE PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-HTTP-STREAM.
    IF STATUS-CODE < 200 OR STATUS-CODE >= 400
        GO TO PROTOCOL-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF HEADER-COUNT == 0
        GO TO PROTOCOL-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9850 TO STREAM-HEALTH-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 STATUS-CODE.
    WEIGHT 30 BODY-LEN.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

PROTOCOL-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO STREAM-HEALTH-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
